  "description": ".Net Core and .Net Framework HttpClientFactory compatible extension methods for HttpClient supporting typed REST verbs from JSON, XML and URL encoded form endpoints, bearer tokens and cookies. Built-in conversion of any request object to JSON or querystring. Includes Uri concatenation helpers and Cookie accessor.  Also supports FormUrlEncoded and binary (byte array) MultipartForm requests.",
